&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;HTTP/1.1, HTTP/2, HTTP/3 — TLS, DNS, and browser networking&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Cookies, browser storage, caching, redirects, and session management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;JavaScript execution and modern client-side rendering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Resource loading, page lifecycle, and browser networking&lt;/li&gt;
